# Firebase Admin Service Account (Firebase Console -> Project Settings -> Service Accounts -> Generate New Private Key)
# Paste as a single-line JSON string or base64-encoded string:
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY='{"type":"service_account","project_id":"mahesh-flora","private_key_id":"...","private_key":"-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n","client_email":"firebase-adminsdk-...@mahesh-flora.iam.gserviceaccount.com"}'

# Razorpay Test Configuration (Optional in Dev Mode; test payment simulator active if missing)
